            "Initials": "S",
            "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "Psychologist at the Glenrose Rehabilitation Hospital in Edmonton, AB, at the time of this study. He currently works in private practice in the Edmonton area."}
          }
        ]
      },
      "ArticleTitle": "Longitudinal Evaluation of a Parent and School Team-Mediated Workshop Intervention for Reducing Challenging Behaviours in Children with Autism Spectrum Disorder.",
